# Docker build context exclusions (build runs from the repo root).
# Prevents secrets, host dependencies and large/local-only artifacts from being
# baked into images (see audit C2/H9: studio-web/.env with JWT_SECRET was being
# COPYied into the runtime image because there was no .dockerignore).

# VCS / editor / tooling
.git
.gitignore
.ai-memory
.idea
.vscode

# Secrets & local env — never ship into an image
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Host-installed dependencies & build outputs (images install/build their own)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-electron
**/target
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Logs
**/*.log
**/logs

# Local-only data / dumps / vendor material (large, sensitive, not needed at runtime)
backend/*.sql
backend/db_migration_backup_*/
backend/data
e签宝sdk/
ui-demo/
案例图/
法大大截图/
docs/
TEST-REPORT.md
